# Frame-counted logic in the platformer build (a9, 352x416).
# Found with ProbePatcher + RmwFinder + CallTracePatcher, reviewed by hand, and checked by
# comparing logged player trajectories between Original and Smooth modes.
#
# <class> <method> <desc> <owner.field> <occurrence> <gate|scale>
# <class> <method> <desc> HELPER <timestep field>       velocity helper: original step, once per original frame
# <class> <method> <desc> RESYNC <owner.name(desc)> <occ>  restart the original-frame clock before this call

# Acceleration/gravity helper used for every entity: n = clamp(n +/- accel*dt, cap)
f a (IIIZ)I HELPER m.h
# Jump/flutter impulse: the next velocity update must land exactly one original frame later
f b (III)Z RESYNC f.d(I)V 0

# Countdown timer: E-- every frame while > 0
f a (Z)I f.E 0 scale
# Over-speed braking: t -= C (or D) every frame while |t| > B
f a (Z)I f.t 2 gate
# Coasting friction with no direction held: t += X / t -= X every frame
f a (Z)I f.t 15 gate
f a (Z)I f.t 17 gate
# Velocity damping: t -= t * 6 / 24 every frame
f e ()Z f.t 0 gate
# Story text scroll: O -= 4 every frame
m t ()V m.O 1 scale
# Paint frame counter (blinking, cycling effects)
o paint (Ljavax/microedition/lcdui/Graphics;)V o.n 0 scale
